{"code":0,"message":"OK","data":{"info":[{"gid":386,"name":"黄皓","avatar":"https://web.sanguosha.com//220/miniGame/release/laya2/res/runtime/m/general/skinShop/386.png","cover":"https://web.sanguosha.com//220/miniGame/release/laya2/res/runtime/m/general/big/static/38600.png","label":["防御","控制","卖血"],"figure":"蜀","figure_py":"shu","quality":"稀有","biography":"宦官。为后主刘禅所宠，专秉朝政。黄皓与大将军姜维不睦，维启后主杀之，后主不从。皓阴以心腹阎宇替维。景耀六年，蜀亡，邓艾预欲杀之，皓贿赂左右得免。及后主迁洛阳，皓为司马昭凌迟处死。","characteristic":"减少敌人对主公的威胁，贿赂敌人以逃生。没有牌时很脆弱。","hp":3,"initial_hp":0,"score":0}],"radar":[{"name":"主公","value":5},{"name":"忠臣","value":5},{"name":"反贼","value":3},{"name":"内奸","value":4}],"deeds":[]}}